cff-version: 1.2.0
message: 'To cite package "camtraptor" in publications use:'
type: software
license: MIT
title: 'camtraptor: Explore and Visualize Camera Trap Data Packages'
version: 1.0.0
doi: 10.32614/CRAN.package.camtraptor
abstract: Explore and visualize Camera Trap Data Packages ('Camtrap DP', <https://camtrap-dp.tdwg.org/>).
  camtraptor offers a step-by-step workflow to read Camtrap DP files, filter data
  of interest, summarize information (e.g. number of observed species) and visualize
  this per deployment on an interactive map. You can also use it to transform data
  for analysis in 'camtrapR'.
